# ── AI endpoint ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Waypoint's AI pipeline speaks plain OpenAI Chat Completions, so any
# compatible endpoint works. For Tencent-internal material (minutes, MOM
# digests, account briefs) point it at Hunyuan — the current preview model
# is `hy4-preview`, fully OpenAI-compatible:
#
#   AI_BASE_URL=https://api.hunyuan.cloud.tencent.com/v1
#   AI_MODEL=hy4-preview
#   AI_FAST_MODEL=hy4-preview
#
# Note: Hunyuan features are migrating to TokenHub — if the direct hunyuan
# endpoint stops answering, check the TokenHub console for the new base URL
# and key (the API shape stays the same).
AI_BASE_URL=
AI_MODEL=
AI_FAST_MODEL=
AI_API_KEY=

# Optional budgets (defaults in server/ai.mjs)
# AI_MAX_TOKENS=6000
# AI_TIMEOUT_MS=45000
